SUMMARY:Midday Meditations
DTSTART;TZID=MST;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260306T120000
DTEND;TZID=MST;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260306T130000
UID:212506c83973d58a44a98a6f9e0cf2f3@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:Join Mesa Owen\, Clinical Social Worker (LCSW)\, for a gentle 
 midday meditation designed to help you pause\, reset\, and reconnect in th
 e middle of the day. These 30-minute sessions offer simple\, accessible me
 ditation practices to support steadiness\, clarity\, and nervous system re
 gulation—no prior experience needed. The Wellness Collective space will 
 be open from 12:00–1:00 PM\, with guided meditation held from 12:15–12
 :45 PM. You’re welcome to arrive early\, stay a bit after\, or simply dr
 op in for the meditation itself. This is a chance to step out of the rush 
 of the week and spend a few quiet moments in shared presence and care. Eve
 ry Friday in March Meditation: 12:15–12:45 PM Space open: 12:00–1:00 P
 M https://wellnesscollectivemoab.com/join-a-class-or-workshop/ola/services
 /midday-meditations
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
